.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-pr-merge - Merge a pull request on GitHub


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit pr merge [number] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Merges an open pull request by number. If number is omitted, attempts to find and merge the open PR for the current branch.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--allow-no-checks\fP[=false]
	Allow a release or Renovate pull request that reports no checks to merge

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for merge

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the result as a JSON envelope

.PP
\fB--method\fP="merge"
	Merge method (merge, squash, rebase, rebase-merge)

.PP
\fB--override\fP=""
	Merge despite failing checks and record the reason as a PR comment


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

.PP
\fB--dir\fP="."
	Path to repository directory (default: current directory)


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-pr(1)\fP
